{
  "name": "05 Order Status Update Webhook",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Overview – Workflow 05\n**Goal:** the store/courier system calls this webhook when an order status changes.\n\n`POST /webhook/order-update` with JSON body:\n`{\"order_id\": \"UT1003\", \"status\": \"delayed\", \"new_expected_delivery\": \"2026-10-15\"}`\n(`new_expected_delivery` is optional)\n\nFlow: update `orders` in Postgres → if status is `delayed`, SMS the customer via Twilio → reply with JSON.\n\nCourse: 3–4 (webhooks, IF node), 19–20 (Postgres), 21–22 & capstone (Twilio SMS).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1df84b4f-0d83-5943-b98a-4a2a985d052c",
      "name": "Overview – Workflow 05",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "order-update",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ac9d5291-f274-5bda-8224-0a066d5f98f7",
      "name": "Order Update Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "03649e09-8ed1-536b-b9cb-81a526d4035c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE orders\nSET status = LOWER($2),\n    expected_delivery = COALESCE(NULLIF($3, '')::date, expected_delivery),\n    updated_at = now()\nWHERE order_id = UPPER($1)\nRETURNING order_id, customer_name, phone, status, expected_delivery;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.body.order_id, $json.body.status, $json.body.new_expected_delivery || '' ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "9afb0151-29ae-5e96-9076-57d0c0f4d0cb",
      "name": "Update Order Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_postgres",
          "name": "Supabase Postgres"
        }
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "delayed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a26c0b98-e5af-5224-a816-8519ade987e3",
      "name": "Is Delayed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "from": "+10000000000",
        "to": "={{ $json.phone }}",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.customer_name }}, sorry! Your UrbanThread order {{ $json.order_id }} is delayed. New expected delivery: {{ $json.expected_delivery ? DateTime.fromISO(String($json.expected_delivery).slice(0, 10)).toFormat('dd LLL yyyy') : 'we will update you soon' }}. Reply or chat with ShopAssist for help.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "24ee094e-91ed-5df4-a078-3d8042e6b6c2",
      "name": "SMS Delay Notice (Twilio)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        -120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_twilio",
          "name": "Twilio account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  ok: !!$('Update Order Status').item.json.order_id,\n  order_id: $('Update Order Status').item.json.order_id || null,\n  status: $('Update Order Status').item.json.status || null,\n  sms_sent: $('Update Order Status').item.json.status === 'delayed',\n  message: $('Update Order Status').item.json.order_id ? 'Order updated' : 'Order not found'\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d2a686d4-0846-5efe-a5a7-49edf83d3d60",
      "name": "Respond to Caller",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        920,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Test with curl\n```\ncurl -X POST \\\n  https://YOUR-N8N.app.n8n.cloud/webhook-test/order-update \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"order_id\":\"UT1002\",\"status\":\"delayed\",\"new_expected_delivery\":\"2026-10-15\"}'\n```\nUse `/webhook-test/` while testing in the editor, `/webhook/` after activating.\nUnknown order IDs return `ok: false` (Postgres node has *Always Output Data* on).",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "8c0696dc-0e6c-5b1e-a4ec-5cad6ee73b88",
      "name": "Test with curl",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -60
      ]
    }
  ],
